{
  "id": "7dpDJs5V0Eex97as",
  "name": "AI Lead Qualifier — score, route & draft a reply",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Lead Qualifier\nScores every inbound lead against your **ideal customer profile**, then routes it.\n\n**Flow**\n1. Website form / CRM posts the lead to the webhook\n2. Gemini returns a score, tier, reasons and a reply draft (structured JSON)\n3. The webhook responds instantly with the result\n4. Live runs are logged to Google Sheets; hot leads (70+) ping `#sales` on Slack\n\n**Setup:** add a Google Gemini credential (free API key from Google AI Studio), a Google Sheets credential + sheet, and a Slack credential. Edit the ICP in the system prompt.\n\nSend `\"demo\": true` in the body to skip the Sheets/Slack side effects.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "2f5dae6c-9183-514c-a7fb-d625ccf1c7a3",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead-qualifier",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
